125 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 71 0 R/E(values: excellence, resilience, integrity, passion, and service. Additionally, we have built a strong organizational foundation to ensure that Rule the Board\220s positive impact continues well into the future as our team and the program grows/expands. Our team has already welcomed four new administrative members and two additional coaches. Together, we are shaping the futures of our scholars, families, and communities. )/Pg 11 0 R/K[0]>>
endobj

126 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 71 0 R/E(Next, we would like to take a moment to recognize the impact that Rule the Board has had on a personal level for our students. The progress we have witnessed extends far beyond ratings and results: our scholars are more confident, resilient, and thorough. They have learned more than chess; they have practiced how to approach challenges with patience and carry themselves with integrity. They have grown in more ways than we can count and inspire us to continue creating a meaningful impact.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

